      "advisorApproval": false,
      "notes": "The major requires one of the two, not both. The department page lists 'ENGRD 2610 or ENGRD 2620', and the catalog lists one ENGRD from Category 2. Taking both doesn't fill more: the second is in the same category, so it can't be the second Engineering Distribution, and it's cross-listed with MSE, so it isn't an outside technical elective.",
